Validate schema definitions or data

Usage: kdlith vet <COMMAND>

Commands:
  schema  Vet a schema definition under the bundled meta-schema, or the one `--meta-schema` names, itself vetted with complete checking; the meta-schema itself (the schema named schema) is vetted against its own canonical definition
  data    Bind data documents against the schema `--schema` names (or the meta-schema itself), under the bundled meta-schema or `--meta-schema`, then link their references; items go to stdout as JSON lines

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
error[KDLITH-CLI001]: a subcommand is required but one was not provided
  help: Pass a value of the documented form; see the command's --help
